{c: Verse 1}
[Cm]Dil chahta hai, dil chahta hai,        [Cm][D#][F][Cm]Dil chahta hai kabhi na bite chamkile din
[Cm][D#][F][Cm]Dil chahta hai hum na rahe kabhi yaro ke bin        [F][D#]Din din bhar ho pyaari baatein;
[F][D#]Jhoome shaame, gaaye raatein;        [Dm][Gm][Cm]Masti mein rahe dooba dooba hameshaa samaa
[Dm][Gm][Cm]Humko raahon me yunhi milti rahe khushiya        [Cm][D#][F][Cm]Dil chahta hai kabhi na bite chamkile din
[Cm][D#][F][Cm]Dil chahta hai hum na rahe kabhi yaro ke bin

[Cm]Jagmagate hai zilmilate hai apne raaste;        [Cm]Yeh khushi rahe, roshni rahe apne waaste.
[Cm]Jagmagate hai zilmilate hai apne raaste;        [Cm]Yeh khushi rahe, roshni rahe apne waaste.
[G#][A#][Cm]Oh ho ho ho ho.....oh ho ho ho ho...        [G#][A#][Cm]Oh ho ho ho ho.....oh ho ho ho ho...
[G#][A#][Cm]Oh ho ho ho ho.....oh ho ho ho ho...        [G#][A#][Cm]Oh ho ho ho ho.....oh ho ho ho ho...

[F][D#]Jahan ruke hum, jahan bhi jaayein,        [F][D#]Jo hum chaahein, woh hum paayein.
[Dm][Gm][D#]Masti mein rahe dooba dooba hameshaa samaa        [Dm][Gm][Cm]Humko raahon me yunhi milti rahe khushiya
[Cm]Dil chahta hai....

[Cm][Gm]Kaisa ajab yeh safar hai,        [D#][A#]socho to har ik hi bekhabar hai,
